    "created_at": "2021-04-26T10:58:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-04-26T10:58:45Z",
    "body": "`starship print-config --default` currently uses the wrong defaults for top-level keys like `format` (#2603 #2605). I think the shell doesn't actually hang but becomes empty because of the `format = ''`.\r\nYou can manually fix this by replacing the generated top-level section with this:\r\n```toml\r\nformat = '$all'\r\nscan_timeout = 30\r\ncommand_timeout = 500\r\nadd_newline = true\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
