    "body": "I just experienced the same issue, and I thought my shell was frozen.\r\n\r\nAfter replacing the top-level section with the code from @davidkna, it seems to work as before (without any config file).\r\n\r\nThat was scary! Good thing I had a non-starship terminal still open, because it didn't even occur to me that I could still run commands in the starship terminal that appeared to be frozen.",
